<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Destec Energy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Destec Energy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it downgraded Destec Energy Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited announcement that NGC Corp and AES Corp agreed to purchase Destec for $1.27 billion. Said deal set a ceiling price for Destec's shares.</p>
<p>-- Destec's shares remained unchanged at 20-5/8.</p>
</text>
